00:35:06,632 --> 00:35:11,432
うん、ステージ衣装を着た、キミの絵！So cute……！
Yes! A drawing of you in your stage outfit! So cute...!

376
00:35:12,432 --> 00:35:16,232
ちょ、ちょっとあたしにはかわいすぎない？
Isn't it... a bit too cute for me?

377
00:35:16,432 --> 00:35:19,932
そんなことないよー！すっごくぴったり！
That's not true! It fits you perfectly!

378
00:35:20,232 --> 00:35:23,032
そ、そうかな……？
Y-You think so...?

379
00:35:23,232 --> 00:35:26,632
きみはこのステージ衣装を着て……
Wear this stage outfit and...

380
00:35:26,932 --> 00:35:29,432
Let's sing with me!!

381
00:35:50,932 --> 00:35:54,432
YEAH~

382
00:35:54,432 --> 00:35:57,732
YEAH~

383
00:36:04,932 --> 00:36:08,332
The knacks of surviving in this world

384
00:36:08,332 --> 00:36:11,932
are being human and being right

385
00:36:11,932 --> 00:36:15,532
Everyone keeps telling me to grow up fast

386
00:36:15,532 --> 00:36:18,732
And it is so tough, can't wrap my head around it

387
00:36:18,732 --> 00:36:20,732
Your unfair rules

388
00:36:20,732 --> 00:36:22,732
Ego trip into a loop

389
00:36:22,732 --> 00:36:25,732
We do belong nowhere in this world

390
00:36:25,732 --> 00:36:27,732
Yet we are surviving

391
00:36:27,732 --> 00:36:29,732
Getting through anything

392
00:36:29,732 --> 00:36:32,532
Stay alive

393
00:36:32,532 --> 00:36:35,332
Hated ones Naked hearts

394
00:36:35,332 --> 00:36:39,032
Worthless games that never end

395
00:36:39,032 --> 00:36:43,532
Found them in the darkness in the end

396
00:36:44,032 --> 00:36:50,732
何が正しくて何が間違っているんだ
What is right, and what is wrong?

397
00:36:50,732 --> 00:36:52,932
僕はただ
I just...

398
00:36:52,932 --> 00:36:58,632
ここで生きてると叫びたいだけ
want to scream that I am alive right here

399
00:36:58,632 --> 00:37:01,932
I heard voices calling out my true name

400
00:37:01,932 --> 00:37:05,232
I will never give up or be swayed anymore

401
00:37:05,232 --> 00:37:07,432
Nobody can stop me

402
00:37:07,432 --> 00:37:08,932
This is the way I am

403
00:37:08,932 --> 00:37:12,932
I'll EXECUTE you, drop dead baby!!

404
00:37:12,932 --> 00:37:16,432
YEAH~

405
00:37:26,932 --> 00:37:30,432
Everyone wanna choose the right path only

406
00:37:30,432 --> 00:37:33,732
They would seek salvation in this closed world

407
00:37:33,732 --> 00:37:37,132
Filthy hands and mind never get clean again though

408
00:37:37,132 --> 00:37:40,232
And it is so tough, can't wrap my head around it

409
00:37:40,232 --> 00:37:42,132
Cannot turn the clock back

410
00:37:42,132 --> 00:37:44,032
Cannot take a turn back

411
00:37:44,032 --> 00:37:47,132
We do belong nowhere in this world

412
00:37:47,132 --> 00:37:49,032
Yet we are surviving

413
00:37:49,032 --> 00:37:51,132
Getting through anything

414
00:37:51,132 --> 00:37:54,032
Stay alive

415
00:37:54,032 --> 00:37:56,932
Missing piece Warmth of hands

416
00:37:56,932 --> 00:38:00,732
Joys and even stabbing pains

417
00:38:00,732 --> 00:38:05,132
Found them in the darkness in the end

418
00:38:05,732 --> 00:38:12,432
何が正しくて何が間違っているんだ
What is right, and what is wrong?

419
00:38:12,432 --> 00:38:14,532
誰だって
No matter who we are,

420
00:38:14,532 --> 00:38:20,232
ここで生きてると叫んでいるのに
we are all screaming that we are alive right here, yet...

421
00:38:20,232 --> 00:38:23,532
Facing what they really want to do,

422
00:38:23,532 --> 00:38:27,232
They'll make it at the cost of everything

423
00:38:27,232 --> 00:38:29,032
Nobody can stop me

424
00:38:29,032 --> 00:38:30,632
This is the way I am

425
00:38:30,632 --> 00:38:34,632
I'll EXECUTE you, drop dead baby!!

426
00:38:34,632 --> 00:38:38,232
YEAH~

427
00:39:02,732 --> 00:39:07,132
また失って もう嫌になって
Losing again, I've had enough of it...

428
00:39:07,132 --> 00:39:10,332
それでも消えなくて
...and yet, it won't disappear.

429
00:39:10,332 --> 00:39:16,732
その心の名をなんと言うのだろう
I wonder what we should call the name of this heart.

430
00:39:17,532 --> 00:39:24,132
僕はここで今叫んでいるんだよ
I am screaming right here, right now!

431
00:39:24,132 --> 00:39:25,932
君だって
And you, too,

432
00:39:25,932 --> 00:39:31,432
ここで同じように叫んでいるんだろう
are probably screaming the same way here!

433
00:39:31,432 --> 00:39:34,732
I heard voices calling out my true name

434
00:39:34,732 --> 00:39:37,932
I will never give up or be swayed anymore

435
00:39:37,932 --> 00:39:40,032
Nobody can stop me

436
00:39:40,032 --> 00:39:41,632
This is the way I am

437
00:39:41,632 --> 00:39:45,732
I'll EXECUTE you, drop dead baby!!

438
00:39:45,732 --> 00:39:49,232
YEAH~

439
00:39:51,932 --> 00:39:55,432
So, this is the way I am

440
00:39:55,432 --> 00:39:58,932
YEAH~

441
00:40:10,217 --> 00:40:13,417
色とりどりのかわいらしい『衣装』
A colorful, lovely outfit...

442
00:40:13,417 --> 00:40:17,717
（それは不思議とぴったりと身体に馴染んでいた）
(It felt strangely snug and fit my body perfectly.)

443
00:40:18,217 --> 00:40:23,717
（『衣装』を身にまとい、『ヘッドセット』をつけて、『歌う』あたし）
(Dressed in my outfit, wearing a headset, singing—that's me.)

444
00:40:24,717 --> 00:40:31,017
（あっちのあたしと、今のあたし、どっちが本物なんだろう）
(The me back then, and the me now... I wonder which one is real.)

445
00:40:33,417 --> 00:40:39,617
そういう時はね、難しいことは忘れてぱぁ～っと楽しいことをするに限るかぬぁ～？
In times like that, it's best to forget the hard stuff and do something completely fun!

446
00:40:39,617 --> 00:40:43,217
クレープを焼いたりとか、アロマで癒されたりとか
Like baking crepes, relaxing with aromatherapy,

447
00:40:43,217 --> 00:40:50,717
ベリーダンスを踊ったりとかして気持ちよくなれば、悩み事なんてどこかに飛んでいっちゃうものなんだよ
or doing some belly dancing to feel good... then all your worries will just fly away!

448
00:40:51,217 --> 00:40:53,217
そういうものなの？
Is that really how it works?

449
00:40:53,217 --> 00:40:55,917
うん、そういうものかぬぁ～
Yep, that's exactly how it is!

450
00:40:55,917 --> 00:41:03,217
だって世の中のだいたいのことは、それがどう見えるかぬぁっていうのは見る人次第なんだから
Because most things in this world depend entirely on the perspective of the person looking.

451
00:41:03,217 --> 00:41:11,617
たとえばアキローゼのこの格好が、芸術的に見えるかセクシーに見えるかをあなたたち次第
For example, whether Akirose's outfit here looks artistic or sexy is entirely up to you.

452
00:41:11,617 --> 00:41:15,717
みたいにね？うふふ
Don't you think? Hehehe.

453
00:41:15,717 --> 00:41:18,217
え、あ、うん
Uh, oh, yeah...

454
00:41:18,217 --> 00:41:23,717
そうだ！せっかくこうして出会えたんだから、いっしょに踊ろっか？
I know! Since we've finally met like this, why don't we dance together?

455
00:41:23,717 --> 00:41:26,717
あなたとアキローゼの二人で
Just you and Akirose, the two of us.

456
00:41:26,717 --> 00:41:32,217
え、でもあたし、踊ったことなんてないんだけど
Wait, but I've never danced before...

457
00:41:32,217 --> 00:41:41,717
だいじょうぶだいじょうぶ、これはあなたのためだけに考えた、“踊り子アキローゼの振り付け”だから
It's totally fine! This choreography was created by 'Dancer Akirose' just for you.

458
00:41:41,717 --> 00:41:45,217
ね？
Right?

459
00:41:53,217 --> 00:41:59,217
とある竜の恋の歌
[Song: A Certain Dragon's Love Song]

460
00:41:15,417 --> 00:41:19,017
踊る舞い立つ大地に
On the dancing, soaring earth,

461
00:42:19,017 --> 00:42:23,017
恋の歌響けば
When the song of love echoes,

462
00:42:23,017 --> 00:42:27,017
狂いだす歯車
The gears begin to turn madly,

463
00:42:27,017 --> 00:42:31,217
止められぬ定めが
An unstoppable destiny

464
00:42:31,217 --> 00:42:34,217
弾けた
Has burst forth.

465
00:42:34,217 --> 00:42:38,717
よみがえる今
Now, awakening,

466
00:42:38,717 --> 00:42:44,217
古にしえより
from ancient times,

467
00:42:44,217 --> 00:42:49,217
世紀末の恋
a love at the end of the century

468
00:42:49,217 --> 00:42:53,717
目覚めた
has awakened.

469
00:42:53,717 --> 00:42:58,017
絆を求めて
Seeking a bond,

470
00:42:58,017 --> 00:43:02,717
炎はほとばしる
the flames gush forth.

471
00:43:02,717 --> 00:43:07,717
破壊と再生
Destruction and rebirth,

472
00:43:07,717 --> 00:43:13,717
気高き君の気迫
your noble, powerful spirit.

473
00:43:37,017 --> 00:43:40,417
透き通る魂
A transparent soul,

474
00:43:40,417 --> 00:43:45,017
嘘のない気高く
honest and noble,

475
00:43:45,017 --> 00:43:49,017
限界を抱えて
facing our limits,

476
00:43:49,017 --> 00:43:53,217
未熟な恋持つ
carrying an immature love,

477
00:43:53,217 --> 00:43:56,217
愚かさ包み
wrapping around our foolishness,

478
00:43:56,217 --> 00:44:01,017
月灯り今
The moonlight now,

479
00:44:01,017 --> 00:44:05,417
二人照らす
shines upon the two of us.

480
00:44:05,417 --> 00:44:08,717
つかの間の
A fleeting moment

481
00:44:08,717 --> 00:44:14,217
時重ねた
where our times overlapped.

482
00:44:14,717 --> 00:44:19,217
絆の行方を
The destination of our bond,

483
00:44:19,217 --> 00:44:24,217
両手で抱きしめた
I held it tight with both hands.

484
00:44:24,217 --> 00:44:29,017
終わりと始まり
An ending and a beginning,

485
00:44:29,017 --> 00:44:35,217
尊き君の記憶
your precious memories.

486
00:45:17,638 --> 00:45:22,138
歪むの 求める
Warping, seeking...

487
00:45:22,138 --> 00:45:27,138
踊るは 音 走る
Dancing to the running sound,

488
00:45:27,138 --> 00:45:31,638
破壊と 再生
destruction and rebirth,

489
00:45:31,638 --> 00:45:36,638
気高き 君の呪縛
the spell of noble you.

490
00:45:37,138 --> 00:45:41,638
歪むの 行方を
The whereabouts of the warp,

491
00:45:41,638 --> 00:45:46,638
両手で 抱きしめた
I embraced with both hands.

492
00:45:46,638 --> 00:45:51,138
終わりと 始まり
The end and the beginning,

493
00:45:51,138 --> 00:45:56,138
尊き 君の記憶
your precious memories.

494
00:46:39,038 --> 00:46:47,038
(どこか懐かしいだれかと出会う度に、頭に浮かぶ映像が鮮明になってくる)
(Every time I meet someone strangely familiar, the images floating in my mind become clearer.)

495
00:46:47,438 --> 00:46:51,638
(もう少しで……何かがわかりそうな気がした)
(I felt like, just a little more... and I would understand something.)

496
00:46:53,738 --> 00:46:56,438
それって、「ライブ」なんじゃないかな？
Isn't that a "live concert"?

497
00:46:56,638 --> 00:46:57,638
「ライブ」？
A live concert?

498
00:46:58,138 --> 00:47:07,638
うん、そう。私、旅芸人だから噂で聞いたことがあるんだけど、「オンガク」があった頃にはよく開催されてたんだって。
Yeah, exactly. I'm a traveling performer, so I've heard rumors about it. Back when "music" existed, they were held often.

499
00:47:08,138 --> 00:47:09,638
うーん……
Hmm...

500
00:47:10,738 --> 00:47:15,438
(そうだ、あたしは「ライブ」をやっていたんだ――)
(That's right... I was doing live concerts...)

501
00:47:16,738 --> 00:47:21,138
ねえ、気になるなら今からここで私と一緒にやってみる？
Hey, if you're curious, do you want to try doing one with me right here, right now?

502
00:47:21,438 --> 00:47:22,438
え？
Eh?

503
00:47:22,938 --> 00:47:26,038
ていうかやろうよ！あなたとならやってみたい！
I mean, let's do it! I want to try it with you!

504
00:47:26,238 --> 00:47:29,138
――「ライブ」ってやつを！
—That "live concert" thing!

505
00:47:34,638 --> 00:47:39,838
とおくできこえる
Hearing from afar,

506
00:47:40,138 --> 00:47:45,938
わたしをよぶこえ
a voice calling me.

507
00:47:46,438 --> 00:47:51,638
あなたのなみだの
The reason for your tears...

508
00:47:51,638 --> 00:47:57,238
りゆうをしってたはずなのに
...I should have known it, and yet.

509
00:47:57,638 --> 00:48:00,638
かわくまえに
Before it dries,

510
00:48:00,638 --> 00:48:03,438
かれるまえに
before it withers,

511
00:48:03,638 --> 00:48:09,638
すべてささげようと
I will offer everything...

512
00:48:10,138 --> 00:48:16,638
あなたにだけ
...only to you.

513
00:48:21,638 --> 00:48:27,138
なにをもとめるのか
What is it that I seek?

514
00:48:27,138 --> 00:48:32,438
だれをあいするのかさえ わからず
Without even knowing who to love,

515
00:48:32,638 --> 00:48:37,638
はいのようにくちていくこころに
In my heart decaying like ash,

516
00:48:37,638 --> 00:48:43,138
あなたのかけらだけは
only fragments of you remain.

517
00:48:43,638 --> 00:48:48,638
てさぐりでもかたちをなぞれば
If I trace your shape, even if fumbling,

518
00:48:48,638 --> 00:48:52,638
ながいねむりのなか
inside this long sleep...

519
00:48:52,638 --> 00:48:58,838
あなたをゆめみるでしょう
...I will surely dream of you.

520
00:48:58,838 --> 00:49:03,638
ふたり みなれたあの日々を何度でも
We'll recall those familiar days over and over.

521
00:49:03,638 --> 00:49:09,138
よあけは あなたにだけ
The dawn is only for you,

522
00:49:09,138 --> 00:49:16,138
そらには もうはてがないから
because the sky has no end anymore.

523
00:49:27,638 --> 00:49:32,638
なにをもとめたのか
What did I seek?

524
00:49:32,638 --> 00:49:37,438
とおいひのわたしにいまといかけ
I ask my past self of distant days.

525
00:49:37,638 --> 00:49:42,638
くだかれ いろあせ おちていく
Shattered, faded, and falling away,

526
00:49:42,638 --> 00:49:48,638
あのかけらたちはどこへ
where did those fragments go?

527
00:49:48,638 --> 00:49:51,638
あのかけらたちはどこへ
Where did those fragments go...

528
00:50:09,356 --> 00:50:14,456
手探りでも かたちを なぞった
Fumbling around, I traced the shape...

529
00:50:14,456 --> 00:50:21,456
長い夢の中で いま
...within this long dream, now...

530
00:50:21,456 --> 00:50:27,356
あなたと また出会えた
...I was able to meet you again.

531
00:50:27,356 --> 00:50:32,456
ふたり 願ったこの瞬間を最後まで
Until the end of this moment we both wished for...

532
00:50:32,456 --> 00:50:38,356
広がる 青い空が
...the sprawling blue sky...

533
00:50:38,356 --> 00:50:44,456
あなたを いつでも見てるから
...will always be watching over you.

534
00:51:11,956 --> 00:51:16,056
（光の塔はもう目の前に迫っていた）
(The Tower of Light was already looming before my eyes.)

535
00:51:16,056 --> 00:51:22,056
（それにつれて、頭に浮かぶ映像はさらに鮮明になってきていた）
(Along with that, the images in my head were becoming even clearer.)

536
00:51:23,656 --> 00:51:27,256
（まるで夢から覚めるように）
(Like waking up from a dream...)

537
00:51:27,656 --> 00:51:32,656
（まるでそれが本物であるかのように）
(...as if it were the real thing.)

538
00:51:33,056 --> 00:51:36,056
（ーー『ライブ』をしていた場所が）
(—the place where we held the "live" concert...)

539
00:51:37,856 --> 00:51:39,656
･･･着いた
...We're here.

540
00:51:40,056 --> 00:51:43,456
ここが･･･光の塔
So this is... the Tower of Light.

541
00:51:43,656 --> 00:51:49,256
塔っていうよりも、何かの舞台みたいにも見えるな
Rather than a tower, it looks more like some kind of stage.

542
00:51:49,656 --> 00:51:56,256
似てる･･･気がする。あの、『ライブ』をやっていた場所に
It feels... similar to that place where we held the "live" concert.

543
00:51:57,056 --> 00:52:00,256
いらっしゃい、ライオンさん
Welcome, Lion-san.

544
00:52:00,456 --> 00:52:06,056
キミが･･･願いを叶えてくれる天使？
Are you... the angel who will grant my wish?

545
00:52:06,856 --> 00:52:11,156
うん、そう。キミが来るのを待ってたよ
Yes, that's right. I've been waiting for you to come.

546
00:52:11,656 --> 00:52:18,656
この世界に･･･『オンガク』を取り戻すことができるキミを
For you, who can restore "music" to this world.

547
00:52:19,156 --> 00:52:22,056
『オンガク』を･･･あたしが･･･？
"Music"... by me...?

548
00:52:22,956 --> 00:52:24,656
そうだよ
Yes, indeed.

549
00:52:25,056 --> 00:52:32,056
ここに来るまでにたくさんのものを受け取ったキミは、もう『オンガク』が何か分かってるんじゃないかな？
Having received so many things on your way here, I think you already know what "music" is, don't you?

550
00:52:32,656 --> 00:52:35,956
ほら、ボクと一緒に飛ぼうーー
Come, let's fly together—

551
00:53:18,156 --> 00:53:26,156
囚われた切望の淵で 私を抱きしめてください
In the depths of captive yearning, please embrace me.

552
00:53:26,656 --> 00:53:31,456
静寂に埋め尽くされて
Completely buried in silence,

553
00:53:31,456 --> 00:53:35,856
独りで凍えてる
...I am freezing all alone.

554
00:53:35,856 --> 00:53:40,256
崩れ落ちていく 楽園の果てで
Crumbling down at the end of paradise,

555
00:53:40,256 --> 00:53:44,656
忘れられた祈りが響いてる
...a forgotten prayer echoes.

556
00:53:44,656 --> 00:53:50,456
支配する闇の中でも
Even within the dominating darkness,

557
00:53:50,456 --> 00:53:53,956
枯れない
...never withering...

558
00:53:53,956 --> 00:53:59,156
愛よ目覚めよ 永久に
...awake, oh love, for eternity!

559
00:53:59,156 --> 00:54:03,256
無限に降る孤独を
The infinitely falling loneliness,

560
00:54:03,256 --> 00:54:08,256
その指で染めてください
...please stain it with your fingers.

561
00:54:08,256 --> 00:54:12,256
叫ぶこの心が
So that this screaming heart...

562
00:54:12,256 --> 00:54:18,156
哀しみを愛せるように
...can learn to love the sadness.

563
00:54:19,456 --> 00:54:28,156
まだ見ぬ あの光の景色へ
To that yet-unseen scenery of light.

564
00:54:46,656 --> 00:54:55,156
乱れ咲く花より深く 優しく口づけてください
Deeper than a profusely blooming flower, please kiss me gently.

565
00:54:55,156 --> 00:54:59,656
ためらいの吐息さえも
Even the hesitant sighs...

566
00:54:59,656 --> 00:55:01,656
命
...and life...

567
00:55:01,835 --> 00:55:04,335
お伴してく
I will accompany you

568
00:55:04,335 --> 00:55:06,935
虹の幻に
into the rainbow's illusion.

569
00:55:06,935 --> 00:55:09,335
祝宴の鐘を
Let the celebratory bells ring,

570
00:55:09,335 --> 00:55:13,635
その温もり　双眸に伝うまで
until that warmth reaches our eyes.

571
00:55:13,635 --> 00:55:16,135
ほとばしる
Surging forward

572
00:55:16,135 --> 00:55:19,335
嵐の中も
even in the midst of the storm,

573
00:55:19,335 --> 00:55:22,335
止まない
never-ending...

574
00:55:22,335 --> 00:55:26,835
愛を目覚めよ
Awaken, my love!

575
00:55:26,835 --> 00:55:31,635
抗えぬ　願いを
Please cherish and welcome

576
00:55:31,635 --> 00:55:36,035
そら愛でて迎えてください
this irresistible wish.

577
00:55:36,035 --> 00:55:40,035
出逢えた歓びに
With a naked heart

578
00:55:40,035 --> 00:55:44,835
震えてる裸の心で
shivering with the joy of meeting you,

579
00:55:44,835 --> 00:55:47,635
求める
I seek...

580
00:55:47,635 --> 00:55:53,135
のは残酷な彼方へ
the cruel yonder.

581
00:56:21,235 --> 00:56:25,335
こぼれ散る涙が
When the spilling tears

582
00:56:25,335 --> 00:56:29,835
キラキラと風に舞う頃
dance sparkling in the wind,

583
00:56:29,835 --> 00:56:35,035
絆は痛みを下さい
let our bond bring me pain,

584
00:56:35,035 --> 00:56:41,035
永遠に消えないように
so that it will never disappear.

585
00:56:41,035 --> 00:56:46,035
無限に降る孤独を
Please entrust me

586
00:56:46,035 --> 00:56:50,235
私に預けてください
with the endlessly falling loneliness.

587
00:56:50,235 --> 00:56:54,635
呼び合えた心が
Our hearts that called to each other

588
00:56:54,635 --> 00:57:00,035
扉を放ち羽ばたく
will unlock the door and soar.

589
00:57:00,035 --> 00:57:06,835
近づくあの始まりの園へ
We draw closer to that garden of beginnings.

590
00:57:41,835 --> 00:57:45,835
数時間前、露天商
[A few hours ago, at a street stall]

591
00:57:45,935 --> 00:57:50,835
へー、この街の露店は品揃えがいいな。
Wow, the street stalls in this town have a great selection.

592
00:57:50,835 --> 00:57:54,435
他では見ない珍しいものがいっぱいある。
There are so many rare things you don't see elsewhere.

593
00:57:54,435 --> 00:58:01,435
旅を続けてると、やっぱりどうしても装備品は必要になってくるからなあ……
When you keep traveling, you always end up needing gear, after all...

594
00:58:01,435 --> 00:58:03,835
ちょっと覗いていこう。
Let's take a quick look.

595
00:58:04,135 --> 00:58:07,835
あ、これいいな。「ブランケットインクッション」
Oh, this is nice! A 'blanket-in-cushion'.

596
00:58:08,335 --> 00:58:11,835
ブランケットなのに袋に収納すればクッションにもなるから、
Even though it's a blanket, it becomes a cushion when packed in its bag,

597
00:58:11,835 --> 00:58:17,335
これがあればどこでも一休みできて、旅のお供にぴったりかも。
so with this, I can rest anywhere. It might be perfect for traveling.

598
00:58:17,335 --> 00:58:21,235
コンパクトなのにふかふかで、寝心地もよさそう。
It's compact yet fluffy, and looks really comfy to sleep on.

599
00:58:21,235 --> 00:58:24,335
収納袋の絵もいい感じ。
The drawing on the storage bag is also nice.

600
00:58:24,335 --> 00:58:26,835
こっちは何だろう？
What's this one?

601
00:58:26,935 --> 00:58:29,835
「SSRBミニウォレット」か……
An 'SSRB Mini Wallet'...

602
00:58:29,835 --> 00:58:35,335
買い物をしたり、小物を収納するのに財布は必需品なんだよね。
A wallet is a must-have for shopping and storing small items.

603
00:58:35,335 --> 00:58:38,835
小銭もお札も入れられるっていうのも嬉しいな。
It's also great that it can hold both coins and bills.

604
00:58:38,835 --> 00:58:43,835
今使ってるのも古くなってきたし、そろそろ買い替えてもいいかも。
The one I'm using now is getting old, so maybe it's time to replace it.

605
00:58:44,335 --> 00:58:48,335
お、この「ブレスレット」、かっこいい。
Oh, this bracelet is cool!

606
00:58:48,335 --> 00:58:55,135
デザインが馴染みやすいから普段使いしやすそうだし、ライオンの加護もついてるんだー。
The design blends in easily, making it great for everyday use, and it even has a lion's blessing!

607
00:58:55,135 --> 00:59:01,635
これを着けてたら君もライオンになれるかも？なーんて。
If you wear this, maybe you can become a lion too? Just kidding!

608
00:59:01,735 --> 00:59:04,835
ふふ、これかわいいな。ヘルメット被ってる。
Hehe, this is cute. It's wearing a helmet.

609
00:59:04,835 --> 00:59:11,835
「SSRBぬいぐるみキーホルダー」……着けてるだけですっごい楽しい気分になれそう。
An 'SSRB Plushie Keychain'... Just having it on seems like it'd cheer me up.

610
00:59:11,835 --> 00:59:19,835
手のひらサイズのちょうどいい大きさだから、バックパックにぶら下げてもいいし、ベルトに留めるのとかもありかな。
It's the perfect palm-sized size, so hanging it on a backpack or clipping it to a belt would work too.

611
00:59:19,835 --> 00:59:23,035
これも買い物候補っと。
Adding this to my shopping list too.

612
00:59:23,035 --> 00:59:26,235
どうしよう、全部欲しい……
What should I do? I want them all...

613
00:59:26,235 --> 00:59:29,335
どれにするか迷う……
I can't decide which one to get...

614
00:59:29,335 --> 00:59:33,035
え、これを全部まとめたセットもあるんだ？
Eh? There's a set that has all of them together?

615
00:59:33,035 --> 00:59:46,835
しかもそれだと、収納袋の絵を描いてるトマリ先生の描き下ろしのポストカードと直筆サイン、箔押しメッセージが特典でついてくるのか。
What's more, that set comes with a special bonus: an exclusive postcard illustrated by Tomari-sensei, along with a handwritten signature and a foil-stamped message!

616
00:59:46,835 --> 00:59:49,135
うーん……
Hmm...

617
00:59:49,135 --> 00:59:51,835
セットでください。
I'll take the set, please.

618
00:59:57,635 --> 01:00:00,835
やっとわかった気がする。
I think I finally understand.

619
01:00:00,835 --> 01:00:06,215
AZKi、みこ、わため……
AZKi, Miko, Watame...

620
01:00:07,348 --> 01:00:11,148
ラオーラ、アキロゼ、リオナ……
Raora, Akirose, Riona...

621
01:00:12,048 --> 01:00:20,248
かなた……そしてこの舞台に向けて声援を送ってくれていたたくさんのみんな
Kanata... and everyone who sent their cheers to this stage.

622
01:00:21,148 --> 01:00:27,048
みんなから受け取ったたくさんのもの――そこに込められた想い
Everything I received from everyone—the feelings within them.

623
01:00:28,048 --> 01:00:31,348
それらが集まって……「オンガク」になる
They gather together... and become 'music'.

624
01:00:32,848 --> 01:00:36,648
新しいあたしが生まれるんだ
A new me is being born.

625
01:00:37,548 --> 01:00:41,148
うん、キミならそう言ってくれると思った
Yeah, I knew you'd say that.

626
01:00:41,848 --> 01:00:47,548
そんなキミに僕から、僕たちから……最後に「曲」を送るよ
To you, from me, from us... we send you one last song.

627
01:00:48,448 --> 01:00:57,448
今日という素敵な日の最後を飾る……新しい獅白ぼたんの誕生を祝う、世界で一つだけの「曲」
To crown the end of this wonderful day... a unique song in the world to celebrate the birth of a new Shishiro Botan.

628
01:00:58,148 --> 01:01:04,248
今のキミなら歌えるはず。「音楽」を――取り戻せるはずだから
The current you should be able to sing it. You should be able to... take back 'music'.

629
01:01:14,548 --> 01:01:20,048
がおってこ！
[Song: Gaotteko!]

630
01:01:23,548 --> 01:01:28,548
がおってこ！ がおってこ！ がおってこ！ がおってこ！ がおってこ！
Ga otte ko, ga otte ko, ga otte ko, ga otte ko, ga otte ko!

631
01:01:28,848 --> 01:01:31,048
15分早起きした
I woke up 15 minutes early

632
01:01:31,048 --> 01:01:33,548
奇跡的な起床記録
A miraculous waking record

633
01:01:33,548 --> 01:01:36,048
珍しい誇らしい朝
A rare, proud morning

634
01:01:36,048 --> 01:01:38,548
誰のせいでしょうか
I wonder whose fault it is?

635
01:01:38,848 --> 01:01:41,248
きみのがおが聴こえると
When I hear your roar

636
01:01:41,248 --> 01:01:44,348
気がするだけかもしれないけど
It might just be my imagination, but

637
01:01:44,348 --> 01:01:46,548
無敵になる気がして
It makes me feel invincible

638
01:01:46,548 --> 01:01:49,248
走って 走って 走れんだ
It makes me run, run, run

639
01:01:49,248 --> 01:01:52,348
Shine on! どこ？って迷っちゃっても
(Shine on!) Even if I get lost, asking 'where?'

640
01:01:52,348 --> 01:01:54,848
Ride on! 合図は遠くの声
(Ride on!) The signal is a voice from afar

641
01:01:54,848 --> 01:01:57,048
Vibe on! 迎えに行くよ
(Vibe on!) I'll come to get you

642
01:01:57,048 --> 01:02:00,048
We're Lions!!
We're lions, oh-oh-oh-oh

643
01:02:00,048 --> 01:02:02,548
Shine on! きみがいる世界が
(Shine on!) The world you're in

644
01:02:02,548 --> 01:02:04,848
Ride on! 輝く合言葉
(Ride on!) Is the shining password

645
01:02:04,848 --> 01:02:07,048
がおっていいヤツみんなで
With all the good folks who roar

646
01:02:07,048 --> 01:02:10,248
Everybody, say 1-2-3!!
Everybody, say, 'One, two, three!'

647
01:02:10,248 --> 01:02:12,548
がおってこ！ がおってこ！
Ga otte ko, ga otte ko

648
01:02:12,548 --> 01:02:15,548
ひとりじゃないって魔法をかけたら
If I cast a spell that says 'you're not alone'

649
01:02:15,548 --> 01:02:17,848
がおってこ！ がおってこ！
Ga otte ko, ga otte ko

650
01:02:17,848 --> 01:02:20,648
不安にだって一緒に吠えて
We'll even roar at our anxieties together

651
01:02:20,648 --> 01:02:22,848
がおってこ！ がおってこ！
Ga otte ko, ga otte ko

652
01:02:22,848 --> 01:02:26,048
笑顔でバフかけちゃえるから
Because we can buff each other with smiles

653
01:02:26,048 --> 01:02:28,248
がおってこ！ がおってこ！
Ga otte ko, ga otte ko

654
01:02:28,248 --> 01:02:31,448
ここがそう 私達の最高
Right here, this is our very best

655
01:02:31,448 --> 01:02:36,048
Rawr rawr!! Yeah! Rawr rawr!! Yeah!
Rawr, rawr, rawr, rawr, yeah! Rawr, rawr, rawr, rawr, yeah!

656
01:02:36,048 --> 01:02:41,548
Rawr rawr!! Yeah! Rawr rawr!! Yeah!
Rawr, rawr, rawr, rawr, yeah! Rawr, rawr, rawr, rawr, yeah!

657
01:02:41,548 --> 01:02:43,848
一日一獅子 Motivation
One lion a day, motivation

658
01:02:43,848 --> 01:02:46,348
低めのやる気がおで上昇
My low motivation rises with a roar

659
01:02:46,348 --> 01:02:48,848
Join us my peeps! 百獣で優勝
Join us my peeps, let's win as the king of beasts

660
01:02:48,848 --> 01:02:51,548
だからがおっていきましょう
So let's all roar together

661
01:02:51,548 --> 01:02:54,048
靴ずれした右足が
My right foot with a blister

662
01:02:54,048 --> 01:02:56,648
今日のやる気を持っていった
Took away my motivation for today

663
01:02:56,648 --> 01:02:58,848
椅子の角っこが小指も
The corner of a chair also

664
01:02:58,848 --> 01:03:01,648
ついでにしばいてくれた
Decided to strangle my pinky toe for good measure

665
01:03:01,648 --> 01:03:04,048
きみのがおが聴こえると
When I hear your roar

666
01:05:00,356 --> 01:05:07,956
それとも、ライブをしてるあたしの方が、今のあたしが見てる夢……？
Or is the me who is performing the live... the dream that the current me is seeing...?

667
01:05:08,356 --> 01:05:10,756
胡蝶の夢って知ってる？
Do you know about the "Butterfly Dream"?

668
01:05:11,056 --> 01:05:17,556
君の言う通り、この世界はもしかしたら、もう一人の君が見ている夢なのかもしれないし、
As you say, this world might be a dream that another you is seeing...

669
01:05:17,556 --> 01:05:25,056
もしかしたらさっきまで君が見ていた「ライブ」こそが、この世界の君が見ている夢かもしれない。
Or maybe the "live" you were watching just now is the dream that you in this world are seeing.

670
01:05:25,356 --> 01:05:34,456
もしかしたらいつか訪れる未来なのかもしれないし、観測された違う世界線を垣間見てるだけなのかもしれない。
Or perhaps it's a future that will arrive someday... Or we might just be glimpsing a different observed timeline.

671
01:05:34,756 --> 01:05:37,656
世界は不確定なんだよ。
The world is uncertain, you know.

672
01:05:38,056 --> 01:05:43,256
「オンガク」は、そんなたくさんの世界を繋ぐ糸みたいなもの。
Music is like a thread that connects all those different worlds.

673
01:05:43,456 --> 01:05:51,756
数え切れないほど存在する可能性の中で、それでも「オンガク」だけはいつだってそこにあるものなの。
Among the countless possibilities that exist, only music is always there.

674
01:05:52,056 --> 01:05:55,456
うちたちが、ぼたんのこと想う気持ちもね！
Just like our feelings for you, Botan!

675
01:05:55,556 --> 01:05:59,456
わため、どこにいてもぼたんちゃんのことが大好きだよぉ！
Watame will always love you, Botan-chan, no matter where she is!

676
01:05:59,656 --> 01:06:03,456
ぼたん先輩の絵、また描きたいなー！
I want to draw Botan-senpai again!

677
01:06:03,756 --> 01:06:11,456
ふふ、ししろんと同じ時間をのんびり過ごすの、アキロゼはすごく好きかな。
Hehe, Akirose really loves spending time relaxing together with Shishiron.

678
01:06:11,756 --> 01:06:16,256
ぼたん先輩、いつかは私と一緒にまた歌ってほしいです。
Botan-senpai, I hope you'll sing with me again someday.

679
01:06:16,456 --> 01:06:19,656
でも、その前に……
But before that...

680
01:06:19,856 --> 01:06:24,056
せーの、誕生日おめでとう！
One, two, happy birthday!

681
01:06:24,456 --> 01:06:30,456
みんな……。ありがとう。
Everyone... Thank you.

682
01:06:30,756 --> 01:06:36,756
みんなの気持ち、送ってくれたお祝いの言葉……確かに受け取ったよ。
I've truly received everyone's feelings and birthday wishes.

683
01:06:37,056 --> 01:06:40,656
すごく……すごくうれしい。
I'm really... really happy.

684
01:06:40,956 --> 01:06:45,556
今ならきっと、前だけを見て走っていられる。
Now, I'm sure I can keep running forward.

685
01:06:46,256 --> 01:06:56,456
これからも、新しい世界に、まだ見たことのないたくさんの可能性に、挑戦することができる！
I can continue to challenge new worlds and many possibilities I've never seen before!

686
01:06:56,756 --> 01:07:01,456
だってここが……あたしたちの最高だから！
Because this place... is our absolute best!

687
01:07:01,756 --> 01:07:05,656
だから、この先も一緒に行こう！
So let's keep going forward together!

688
01:07:06,056 --> 01:07:09,556
次に生まれるのが、どんな世界でも！
No matter what world is born next!

689
01:07:10,056 --> 01:07:15,756
みんなのこと、本当に、本当に大好きだよ！
I really, truly love you all!

690
01:07:17,056 --> 01:07:21,256
（次にあたしが生まれるのは、どこなんだろう）
(Where will I be born next?)

691
01:07:21,756 --> 01:07:26,356
（でもそれが、どこでも大丈夫）
(But wherever it is, it'll be fine.)

692
01:07:26,556 --> 01:07:29,556
（さよならは言わない）
(I won't say goodbye.)

693
01:07:29,856 --> 01:07:37,956
（きっとあたしは、この幸せな物語を胸に、どこまでだって飛べるはずだから）
(Because I'm sure I can fly anywhere with this happy story in my heart.)

694
01:07:38,456 --> 01:07:47,056
（そこに「音楽」と、みんなからもらった温かくて、優しい想いがあれば！）
(As long as there is "music" and the warm, kind feelings I received from everyone!)

695
01:07:48,556 --> 01:07:52,556
（次の世界で、また会おう……！）
(Let's meet again in the next world...!)

696
01:07:52,856 --> 01:07:56,756
（きみがいる世界で……！）
(In the world where you are...!)

697
01:07:57,256 --> 01:08:03,756
▶ 新しい世界に旅立つ？
▶ Depart to a new world?

698
01:08:08,256 --> 01:08:17,056
（だからあたしは世界を旅している）
(That's why I'm traveling the world)

699
01:08:17,256 --> 01:08:26,756
たとえどこにいたとしても、それは……とても大事なことだったはずだから
No matter where you were, that must have been... very important

700
01:08:27,256 --> 01:08:36,756
よーし、あたしの歌で癒してあげるよ。歌っていうの魔法……
Alright, I'll heal you with my song. Songs are magic...

701
01:08:37,256 --> 01:08:46,756
だってうち……ぼたんのことが大好きだから！
Because I... really love Botan!

702
01:08:47,256 --> 01:08:56,756
Let's try! ぼたん先輩！
Let's try! Botan-senpai!

703
01:08:57,256 --> 01:09:06,756
Let's draw with us!

704
01:09:07,256 --> 01:09:12,756
だいたいあなたって子は！これ、あなたのためにしたんだからね。
Why are you like this! I did this for you, you know.

705
01:09:12,756 --> 01:09:16,756
「嘘」すら、あれは優しさの「嘘」なんだから
Even that "lie" was a "lie" of kindness.

706
01:09:17,256 --> 01:09:26,756
うん！いつまでも待ってるよ。
Yeah! I'll wait forever.

707
01:09:27,256 --> 01:09:36,756
みんなのこと、本当に、本当に大好きだよ！
I really, truly love you all!

708
01:10:01,311 --> 01:10:10,011
MUST & RELIVE

